 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? I like a basket on front wheel with a good level of air in the tires. It' easy to reach from side of the road. Bags hang right out and get caught incorners. Stick it on a quick release handlebar rack and get one that locks the basket to the rack. Some thieves still try it. Then the lock is your friend. A simple cable lock might do it. Do you shop at big chain with a locker at the till? If so, your bike is already safer than most people's. It' heavy for small electricity grid, and you can't reach the windows in the back. A basket beats it hands down.",
